{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o014c","title":"夏侯渊围斩梁兴封博昌亭侯","accounts":[{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o014c-account","label":"《诸夏侯曹传第九》正文","text":"夏侯渊围斩梁兴封博昌亭侯","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o014c-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0278","role":"征讨受封","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o014c-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0287","role":"被斩","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o014c-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":212,"label":"建安十七年","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"xiahoucao-y212","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"xiahoucao-q-o014","basis":"建安十七年"},"evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o014c-q","xiahoucao-q-o014","xiahoucao-q-b-5ddbebda291e48a385a3"]},"ordering_evidence":"xiahoucao-e-o014c-q","source_order":[9,60,"O014c"],"order":2143}],"persons":[{"id":"wudi-p0278","name":"夏侯渊","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0287","name":"梁兴","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o014c-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-4de8ec3f953562853055","layer":"original","quote":"围遂、超余党梁兴于鄠〖2〗，拔之，斩兴，封博昌亭侯。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":59,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":59,"end":85},{"id":"xiahoucao-q-b-5ddbebda291e48a385a3","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-5ddbebda291e48a385a3","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗十七年：建安十七年（公元 212）。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":63,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-3ae2b4b8fe9aea30d935","start":0,"end":21},{"id":"xiahoucao-q-o014","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-4de8ec3f953562853055","layer":"original","quote":"与太祖会安定，降杨秋。十七年〖1〗，太祖乃还邺，以渊行护军将军，督朱灵、路招等，屯长安。击破南山贼刘雄〔鸣〕，降其众。围遂、超余党梁兴于鄠〖2〗，拔之，斩兴，封博昌亭侯。马超围凉州刺史韦康于冀〖3〗，渊救康；未到，康败。去冀二百余里，超来逆战。军不利。汧氐反，渊引军还。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":59,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":135}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
